{title: He's Got the Whole World in His Hands}
{artist: African American spiritual}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 96}

Verse 1
[F]He's got the whole world in his hands,
he's got the whole [C7]world in his hands,
he's got the whole world in his [F]hands,
he's got the [C7]whole world in his [F]hands.

Verse 2
[F]He's got the wind and the rain in his hands,
he's got the wind and the [C7]rain in his hands,
he's got the wind and the rain in his [F]hands,
he's got the [C7]whole world in his [F]hands.

Verse 3
[F]He's got you and me, brother, in his hands,
he's got you and me, [C7]sister, in his hands,
he's got you and me, brother, in his [F]hands,
he's got the [C7]whole world in his [F]hands.
